oot configuration. The provider-wide restart protocol is substantially evidenced and independently corroborated by lifecycle boot observations.","limitations":["The restart evidence verifies node health, failed-unit state, persistent configuration, sockets, and package health, but does not separately probe application data or cluster state; no application or clustered workload was identified in the supplied topology."]}
